  "body": "Step into a home where comfort, sunshine and effortless family living come together beautifully.\r\n\r\nThis stylish two-storey weatherboard home offers 179m² of thoughtfully designed space, creating the perfect environment for growing families, entertaining friends and enjoying everyday life.\r\n\r\nThe heart of the home is the generous designer kitchen, dining and lounge area, where large windows capture the sun and create a warm, inviting atmosphere. Sliding doors open to an extensive deck with a pergola to protect you on a rainy day. Your family and friends will love relaxing or entertaining with you here.\r\n\r\nThe fully fenced garden is your children's haven, large enough for a good-sized trampoline and sand pit to fit. You can overlook what they are doing while preparing dinner just steps away.\r\n\r\nUpstairs offers peaceful separation with three generous bedrooms, including a spacious master retreat with ensuite and walk-in wardrobe, plus a well-appointed family bathroom.\r\n\r\nDownstairs offers flexibility with a fourth bedroom or home office, guest powder room, and separate laundry.\r\n\r\nAdditional features include:\r\n• Internal access garage plus off-street parking\r\n• Excellent storage throughout\r\n• Freehold section for long-term peace of mind\r\n\r\nThe location is hard to beat. Just minutes' drive from the St Heliers and Kohimarama and Mission Bay beaches, cafés, shops and lifestyle.\r\n\r\nIn zone for Glendowie College and walking distance to Sacred Heart College Auckland.\r\n\r\nHomes in this sought-after location are always in demand. Act quickly and secure your family’s future today.\r\n\r\nPlease visit www.barfoot.co.nz/913896 and scroll down to download or view: Title; LIM (where available); Particulars and Conditions of Sale by Auction (where applicable); and other informative documents",
